<!--
  Waveform mark: 12 round-capped bars (3 repetitions of a 2r/6r/12r/18r pattern),
  vertically centred, bar width 2r and gap 2r.

  Converted from the former drawable-{h,x,xx,xxx}hdpi/waveform.png rasters, whose
  geometry was measured off the 600x246 xxxhdpi asset, hence the 600x246 viewport,
  where one viewport unit equals one xxxhdpi pixel. Fitted shape matches the original
  raster coverage with IoU 0.979.

  Kept as a vector so the mark has no density-qualified configs: it always ships in
  the base APK and stays resolvable on every device configuration. Resolving it from
  a density split that wasn't installed used to crash Compose's painterResource.

  fillColor is white because every consumer either tints it (Icon tint / ColorFilter)
  or draws it on a dark surface; don't change it without checking all call sites.
-->
